  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, when Heaven Overseeing Tower strikes, three more Shadow Sect Immortal Gu Houses rise to resist: a pavilion with red bricks and green tiles, a manor with white traces flying around, and an altar with shiny golden lights. Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord names Weaving Cocoon Manor among seven Shadow Sect Immortal Gu Houses forced onto the field by that one move, together with Sacred Feather City, Unbreakable Iron Fortress, Blood River Chariot, Nightmare Castle, Green Wave Pavilion, and Golden Altar. The three houses closest to Heaven Overseeing Tower, Green Wave Pavilion, Weaving Cocoon Manor, and Golden Altar, break apart under the fate Immortal Gu attack; their Gu worms fall lifeless with no outer wounds.",
      "chapters": [
        1004
      ],
